{#
| Hanaya — Bonds collection page.
|
| NOTE ON ROUTING (important):
| Salla page routes are FIXED — there is no way to register a custom `/bonds`
| URL. So the reachable way to open Bonds on a live store is through the HOME
| route with `?page=bonds` (handled in index.twig). This bonds.twig file is
| kept as the canonical source and for the standalone preview; the actual body
| lives in the shared partial below so home and this page never drift.
|
| Header & footer come from the master layout. Styles: 04-components/bonds.scss.
#}
{% extends "layouts.master" %}

{% block content %}
  {% include 'pages.partials.hanaya.bonds-body' %}
{% endblock %}

{% block scripts %}
    <script defer src="{{ 'home.js' | asset }}"></script>
{% endblock %}
